{"version":1,"content":"<p>據美國媒體報道，一對華人父母日前向法院起訴OpenAI，指控ChatGPT所使用的GPT-4o模型在其女兒停用抗癲癇藥物的過程中提供了具有誤導性的建議，並勸導其向醫生隱瞞相關情況，最終導致女兒於今年2月去世。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584158.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.255644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:40:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"b326fab50a5821508ee3fa9716aa7cfb2588a1cbfee5949b4dbfed3afbec8f41","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}